<title>CHINA: Huangshan Tourism 96 net 64.01 mln yuan.</title>
<headline>Huangshan Tourism 96 net 64.01 mln yuan.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover		   169.07     vs    137.224</p>
<p> Net profit		  64.01     vs     41.73</p>
<p> Net asset per share     1.70 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share	0.33 yuan</p>
<p>(The company listed its B shares on November 22, 1996)</p>
<p>Company name: Huangshan Tourism Development Co Ltd </p>
<p>Note: the results were published in a company statement on Tuesday. The figures are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international accounting standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed a cash dividend of 0.0254 yuan per share, pending approval of a shareholders meeting, the statement said.</p>
</text>
